{"842780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NavalArt", "steam_appid": 842780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [2843420], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Join our Discord channel  to give feedback, download mods and learn about upcoming updates! Let’s make NavalArt more enjoyable, together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Building <i><strong>NavalArt</strong></i> is a true labor of love. As an indie dev, my vision was simple but massive: to craft the <strong>definitive PC naval sandbox</strong>. It's been a long voyage since our 2018 Early Access launch, and I couldn't have weathered it without the phenomenal support of this community. Every piece of your feedback has shaped the hull of this game. Thank you for believing in this project. I'll always welcome your thoughts in the Steam discussions as we continue to perfect the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-NavalArt is a sandbox game that combines design, construction, physics, and combat, offering players a variety of experience in different stages. Players will play as designer, engineer, and commander, respectively, and guide their fleets through the ages of steel and nerve. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-As a player, you will construct your warships in dock, using parts offered by the game or the mod community. Through careful placing and adjusting of parts, with an <strong>incredibly high degree of freedom</strong>, you can shape your warships to anything you like, from overall hull shapes, to tiny anchor chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/8a16c351d2bdf5a958004d9d3efd4e2d.poster.avif?t=1787198830\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/8a16c351d2bdf5a958004d9d3efd4e2d.webm?t=1787198830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/8a16c351d2bdf5a958004d9d3efd4e2d.mp4?t=1787198830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Each property is critical to your design, as different armor &amp; weapon layouts will have different effects. Take your unfinished/newly finished ships for trials, and see if it is satisfactory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/4d84f1c6cc5e62580f1d9d453566a7f2.poster.avif?t=1787198830\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/4d84f1c6cc5e62580f1d9d453566a7f2.webm?t=1787198830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/4d84f1c6cc5e62580f1d9d453566a7f2.mp4?t=1787198830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-In Quick Battles and Operations, utilize a vast arsenal of weapons spanning from the 19th to the 21st century—including naval guns, torpedoes, carrier-based aircraft, missiles, and more—to annihilate your enemies, complete missions, and claim victory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/f7c5c4191316750b8e87f99b355e025d.poster.avif?t=1787198830\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/f7c5c4191316750b8e87f99b355e025d.webm?t=1787198830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/f7c5c4191316750b8e87f99b355e025d.mp4?t=1787198830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Arm your ship with Anti-Air weapons, including Phalanx CIWS, try to survive in the test scene after several waves of air strikes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/fcf70eacfc8760fdfade011fbfa60e27.poster.avif?t=1787198830\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/fcf70eacfc8760fdfade011fbfa60e27.webm?t=1787198830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/fcf70eacfc8760fdfade011fbfa60e27.mp4?t=1787198830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Experience unique RTS-style Aircraft Carrier gameplay, where altitude is a crucial resource for your warplanes. Configure your squadrons, assign specializations, seize air superiority, and launch devastating aerial strikes against the enemy fleet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/a7e9e1fd293197febc0ea87bc46fa418.poster.avif?t=1787198830\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/a7e9e1fd293197febc0ea87bc46fa418.webm?t=1787198830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/a7e9e1fd293197febc0ea87bc46fa418.mp4?t=1787198830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Walk around your ships as a fellow sailor in Gallery Mode, lineup your fleet and enjoy the parade from your flagship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/f0e9ed72ed31166eb0b1f08f2521698e.poster.avif?t=1787198830\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/f0e9ed72ed31166eb0b1f08f2521698e.webm?t=1787198830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/f0e9ed72ed31166eb0b1f08f2521698e.mp4?t=1787198830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Not in the mood of designing ships? Want more parts to use in the game? Don't forget to visit NavalArt's Steam Workshop to get thousands of warship designs and mods!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/20f41c2f28a8f11e3ef51cf86cdbc252.poster.avif?t=1787198830\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/20f41c2f28a8f11e3ef51cf86cdbc252.webm?t=1787198830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/20f41c2f28a8f11e3ef51cf86cdbc252.mp4?t=1787198830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thousands of Historic Equipment, spanning from ironclads to the modern era</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Numerous Stages</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aircraft Carriers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RTS Air Combat System centered around altitude mechanics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive collection of preset ships</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Under-water View</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time Physics Calculation (including the waves)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Sea Conditions and Day-Night Cycle, including combat in fog, heavy rain, and snow</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career Mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Battle Mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission Stage Mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gallery Mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anti-air Weapon System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Submarine Mechanics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mod Support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sharing designs via Steam Workshop</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Install mods via Steam Workshop</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam-based Multi-player Battles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-player Co-op Stages</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern weapons such as Phalanx and missiles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anti-submarine System</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experimental Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission Editor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Continuously Updated Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More parts (Naval guns, decorations, missiles, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Career Mode chapters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What We Plan to Add</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map Editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather  nodes for the Mission Editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brand-new Career questlines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial Rework</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More new mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rework of legacy gameplay systems</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Join our Discord channel  to give feedback, download mods and learn about upcoming updates! Let’s make NavalArt more enjoyable, together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Building <i><strong>NavalArt</strong></i> is a true labor of love. As an indie dev, my vision was simple but massive: to craft the <strong>definitive PC naval sandbox</strong>. It's been a long voyage since our 2018 Early Access launch, and I couldn't have weathered it without the phenomenal support of this community. Every piece of your feedback has shaped the hull of this game. Thank you for believing in this project. I'll always welcome your thoughts in the Steam discussions as we continue to perfect the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-NavalArt is a sandbox game that combines design, construction, physics, and combat, offering players a variety of experience in different stages. Players will play as designer, engineer, and commander, respectively, and guide their fleets through the ages of steel and nerve. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"